hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2925","It was narrated to us by Salim ibn Junadah, who said: Abu Mu'awiyah narrated to us, from Hisham, from his father, from Aisha (RA), who said: ""I had driven two sacrificial camels (badan) for Hajj, but I lost them. Then Ibn az-Zubayr sent me two other camels, which I slaughtered. Later, I found the first two camels, so I slaughtered them as well. Then she said: 'This is the Sunnah regarding sacrificial"
